                <invention-title lang="de">BENUTZERSCHNITTSTELLEN ZUR VERWALTUNG VON LIVE-KOMMUNIKATIONSSITZUNGEN</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">INTERFACES UTILISATEUR POUR GÉRER DES SESSIONS DE COMMUNICATION EN DIRECT</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">USER INTERFACES FOR MANAGING LIVE COMMUNICATION SESSIONS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present disclosure generally relates to managing live communication sessions. A computer system optionally displays an option to invite the respective user to join the ongoing communication session. A computer system optionally one or more options to modify an appearance of an avatar representing the user of the computer system. A computer system optionally transitions a communication session from a spatial communication session to a non-spatial communication session. A computer system optionally displays information about a participant in a communication session.</p>
            </abstract>
